    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6459" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναδιπλ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>double, fold,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.84
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be made double,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάλαγξ βραχυτέρα ἐγίγνετο ἀναδιπλουμένη</span>
			<i>being made twice as</i> deep, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.5.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Gramm., of a
			word or syllable, <i>reduplicate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.32
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Trypho
				<u>Fr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				98.38
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>repeat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phoeb.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>.</div>
